<title>Updated CPR guidelines tackle choking response, opioid-related emergencies and revised chain of survival - American Heart Association Guidelines | American Heart Association</title>
<meta name="description" content="The “2025 American Heart Association Guidelines for Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) and Emergency Cardiovascular Care (ECC),” published October 22, 2025 in the Association’s flagship journal, Circulation, marks the first full revision of lifesaving resuscitation guidance since 2020. " />
<meta name="keywords" content="2025 American Heart Association Guidelines for Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation,CPR,Emergency Cardiovascular Care,ECC,lifesaving resuscitation guidance,recommendations for managing choking,treating individuals with suspected opioid overdose,lifesaving interventions,cardiac arrest,Ashish Panchal,Javier Lasa">

<meta property="og:title" content="Updated CPR guidelines tackle choking response, opioid-related emergencies and a revised Chain of Survival">

