      <figcaption class="gallerySlider-item-text">
        <h3 class="gallerySlider-item-text-title">Adult Choking Demo video</h3>
        
        <div class="gallerySlider-item-text-description" id="item_description_68faa9de3d63323c95e7738b"><p>A video used for training purposes shows the proper techniques to help an adult who is choking according to the 2025 American Heart Association CPR Guidelines.</p>

<p>copyright American Heart Association</p>
