  <div style="display: none;">
    <div id="attach_info_68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390">
      
      <div class="fancybox-video-wrapper">
        <video class="fancybox-content-video fancybox-video" controls controlsList="nodownload" poster="https://iprsoftwaremedia.com/67/files/20259/68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390_Child%20Choking%20Demo%20video/Child%20Choking%20Demo%20video_thmb.jpg?v=b6260b77-e485-4ced-b499-5f83d955ac42" id="player68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390" data-id="68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390" data-fileid="68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390">
          <source src="https://iprsoftwaremedia.com/67/files/20259/68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390_Child%20Choking%20Demo%20video/Child%20Choking%20Demo%20video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <source src="https://iprsoftwaremedia.com/67/files/20259/68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390_Child%20Choking%20Demo%20video/Child%20Choking%20Demo%20video.webm" type="video/webm" />
          Sorry, your browser doesn\'t support embedded videos, <a href="https://iprsoftwaremedia.com/67/files/20259/Child%20Choking%20Demo%20video.mp4">download</a> and watch with your favorite video player!
          
          <script type="text/srt" id="subtitle68faa9ed3d63323c95e77390" data-label="English" data-lang="en">
            
WEBVTT

09a76da8-b797-4955-9103-a0f23548555a-0
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.580
Choking happens quickly and more often in
children and infants than in adults,

09a76da8-b797-4955-9103-a0f23548555a-1
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:09.000
so it's important to be prepared in case
you need to help a child in distress.

2e2898a7-9f78-4195-b910-f48d0b7f275b-0
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.263
Choking occurs when something gets stuck
in someone's airway and makes it hard for

2e2898a7-9f78-4195-b910-f48d0b7f275b-1
00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:14.000
them to breathe.

c2487d30-ffb0-43ff-9c43-c65f0c6cc20b-0
00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.800
A child experiencing mild choking can
still breathe, speak, and cough.

f3e01acc-762a-4c0a-92ef-30b0cbb8a87f-0
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.680
You may not need to intervene in these
cases.

45a7d9a7-d9d9-48b2-9029-fbfe0f9beec8-0
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.400
A child experiencing severe choking can
no longer breathe, speak, or cough.

fef71be7-aa5c-4b58-9a97-f00d751310be-0

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.560
This is an emergency.

59c49da4-3d51-455b-a5e5-7032015deb64-0
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.640
Any child who is severely choked should
be evaluated by a healthcare professional.

6b7429f6-c0b1-4e33-981c-37c0083449fc-0
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:39.160
It's not always easy to tell if a child
is choking.

278326c1-972a-47f2-8aa9-bf03bf9f208f-0
00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.685
If you're unsure,
ask the child if they are choking and if

278326c1-972a-47f2-8aa9-bf03bf9f208f-1
00:00:42.685 --> 00:00:43.400
you can help.

fb305957-1b61-44ce-b37b-c4eb3bc8e08d-0
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:49.590
If the child's face becomes discolored,
if they're struggling to breathe or make

fb305957-1b61-44ce-b37b-c4eb3bc8e08d-1
00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.067
sounds,
or if they're grabbing at their throat

fb305957-1b61-44ce-b37b-c4eb3bc8e08d-2
00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.440
with their hands,
they are severely choking.

8d2fa4b2-a0e0-4505-81b7-7dc3917ac225-0
00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.164
If someone else is nearby,
have them call 911 and get an AED while

8d2fa4b2-a0e0-4505-81b7-7dc3917ac225-1
00:00:59.164 --> 00:01:03.960
you help the child get into position to
provide choking relief right away.

aade24d0-8cb2-4a95-9129-2297e55e93e2-0
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:09.600
To help a child who is choking,
position yourself by kneeling behind them.

c4c328f1-c72c-4160-86bf-cde6bbbed7c4-0
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.720
Depending on your size and the size of
the child, you may need to stand.

fa61cc7d-f1ef-43d2-8d07-bb2026b46855-0
00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:19.251
Kneel while giving yourself a steady base
and place one hand on the child's

fa61cc7d-f1ef-43d2-8d07-bb2026b46855-1
00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:19.760
shoulder.

3b1f32e8-b1a2-4c7c-a729-8f5151f003e0-0
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:24.448
Then use the heel of your other hand to
give them five forceful back blows

3b1f32e8-b1a2-4c7c-a729-8f5151f003e0-1
00:01:24.448 --> 00:01:25.960
between the shoulder blades.

839ee002-7615-4c6e-a645-cffdf8da45e8-0
00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:30.638
This will push air from their lungs,
helping to force out the object that's

839ee002-7615-4c6e-a645-cffdf8da45e8-1
00:01:30.638 --> 00:01:31.680
blocking the airway.

f538cfb8-d7ce-4758-8f44-9c58d4ae2805-0
00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:37.680
If the five back blows do not clear the
airway, move on to abdominal thrusts.

e26d48e4-8380-44ff-8b30-6b2c937789f5-0
00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.955
For abdominal thrusts,
wrap your arms around the child's waist

e26d48e4-8380-44ff-8b30-6b2c937789f5-1
00:01:41.955 --> 00:01:43.680
so that your hands are in front.

91657c98-4a8b-4ac3-8da3-5bf0da160f0b-0
00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:48.224
Make a fist with one hand and place it
thumb side against the child's waist,

91657c98-4a8b-4ac3-8da3-5bf0da160f0b-1
00:01:48.224 --> 00:01:51.400
just above the belly button and well
below the breastbone.

7edb2b9e-4168-4c2e-b78c-c738206a889b-0
00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.720
Now grab your fist with your other hand.

3a1252fe-a42e-4ff4-b62f-fe200b3a4201-0
00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:58.129
Next,
give quick inward and upward thrust to

3a1252fe-a42e-4ff4-b62f-fe200b3a4201-1
00:01:58.129 --> 00:02:01.661
the abdomen,
making sure your thrust go upward and not

3a1252fe-a42e-4ff4-b62f-fe200b3a4201-2
00:02:01.661 --> 00:02:02.560
straight back.

c6f73832-2cf9-46bf-ab94-853dd51f90e6-0
00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.613
Thrusting upward acts like a cough,
pushing the air out while reducing the

c6f73832-2cf9-46bf-ab94-853dd51f90e6-1
00:02:07.613 --> 00:02:10.320
chances of causing injury to internal
organs.

2f66de47-2f4d-46bd-8b10-fde8bfbd922e-0
00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.186
Alternate between giving 5 back blows
between the shoulder blades and five

2f66de47-2f4d-46bd-8b10-fde8bfbd922e-1
00:02:15.186 --> 00:02:19.469
abdominal thrusts until the object is
forced out and the child can breathe,

2f66de47-2f4d-46bd-8b10-fde8bfbd922e-2
00:02:19.469 --> 00:02:22.400
cough, or speak,
or until they become unresponsive.

56a77723-4c35-414e-b00f-be916b294635-0
00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:27.720
If the choking child is too large for you
to get your arms around their waist,

56a77723-4c35-414e-b00f-be916b294635-1
00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:31.638
or if they're in a wheelchair,
give chest thrusts instead of abdominal

56a77723-4c35-414e-b00f-be916b294635-2
00:02:31.638 --> 00:02:32.080
thrusts.

baaded63-bc26-4223-ad50-bccdb4c7fa08-0
00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:36.040
This is the same method used for large or
pregnant adults.

476d8da1-a210-4473-b0a5-14508b5c0ab0-0
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.522
In these cases,
you'll need to change your hand position

476d8da1-a210-4473-b0a5-14508b5c0ab0-1
00:02:39.522 --> 00:02:42.480
and pull back on the chest and not up on
the abdomen.

aa2538a0-cadf-4613-b411-4002235bf811-0
00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.120
Now I'll demonstrate the correct hand
position for chest thrust.

b53a7d61-70f7-464f-9541-51143ae61fc7-0
00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:49.333
Remember,
make a fist with one hand and place it

b53a7d61-70f7-464f-9541-51143ae61fc7-1
00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:51.640
thumb side against the child's torso.

133a5857-6d7a-4a16-8c5b-5da99932208b-0
00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:56.187
Place your arms under their armpits and
your hands in the center of their chest

133a5857-6d7a-4a16-8c5b-5da99932208b-1
00:02:56.187 --> 00:02:58.000
on the lower half of the breastbone.

c478719f-2faf-4baa-9ce8-43db9f40d785-0
00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:01.120
Pull straight back to give chest thrust.

625ae78b-532b-4139-9bdb-533882b60873-0
00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:06.711
If the child becomes unresponsive,
carefully slide them to the floor face up

625ae78b-532b-4139-9bdb-533882b60873-1
00:03:06.711 --> 00:03:10.320
by slowly walking backward,
supporting their head and neck.

9289dba8-6978-42e2-a392-ff54a9b4b702-0
00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:18.800
Start CPR immediately and use the AED as
soon as it's available.

60cd2c4f-db86-42b9-9c54-22678ef44626-0
00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:22.360
Have someone call 911 if they haven't
already done so.

45243c8b-c222-48ba-af4c-9480a90ec594-0
00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:27.338
After giving 30 chest compressions,
look in the child's mouth to check if the

45243c8b-c222-48ba-af4c-9480a90ec594-1
00:03:27.338 --> 00:03:28.400
object has come out.

bb64dcdb-e778-4766-996d-cb8d5afcea9f-0
00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.120
If you can see the object, take it out.

a7db4219-d8cb-4a71-8fd5-1b2bd7b0b3a4-0
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.517
If you can't see the object,
do not reach into their mouth to try and

a7db4219-d8cb-4a71-8fd5-1b2bd7b0b3a4-1
00:03:35.517 --> 00:03:35.920
find it.

2efea7a4-d2a9-42b5-9272-e19c9994dda1-0
00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.280
You can accidentally push the object in
farther and make things worse.

1a50ee01-83ba-43fc-8f1f-d4361b1dc7b3-0
00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.720
Now that you've checked for the object,
give two breaths.

94155e3e-135e-4ddc-b6a6-bdd82e956b58-0
00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:47.924
Continue cycles of giving 30 compressions,
checking for the object,

94155e3e-135e-4ddc-b6a6-bdd82e956b58-1
00:03:47.924 --> 00:03:52.297
and giving 2 breaths until emergency
responders arrive or the child starts

94155e3e-135e-4ddc-b6a6-bdd82e956b58-2
00:03:52.297 --> 00:03:54.280
responding and breathing normally.

40431544-9d6a-49ac-8def-68275aade52e-0
00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:00.306
If you're alone with a child who becomes
unresponsive after choking and you do not

40431544-9d6a-49ac-8def-68275aade52e-1
00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:03.567
have a phone,
it's important to complete 5 cycles of

40431544-9d6a-49ac-8def-68275aade52e-2
00:04:03.567 --> 00:04:07.751
CPR, starting with giving 30 compressions,
checking for the object,

40431544-9d6a-49ac-8def-68275aade52e-3
00:04:07.751 --> 00:04:12.120
and then giving 2 breaths before you
leave to call 911 and get an AED.

601b3449-6b1c-4c80-b672-f04c48187ba7-0
00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.934
Any child who receives choking relief
should be seen by a healthcare

601b3449-6b1c-4c80-b672-f04c48187ba7-1
00:04:15.934 --> 00:04:16.600
professional.

5f399c24-31c2-4dc7-9a1d-ffd2febb1caf-0
00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.200
Now you're ready to help a child who is
choking.
          </script>
